*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic checks of images and PDFs - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/doctest_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Image Should Match Reference
    [Documentation]    Checks that the image looks like the reference file from data/reference.
    [Arguments]    ${image}    ${reference_file}
    ${reference}    Reference File    ${reference_file}
    Compare Two Images    ${reference}    ${image}

PDF Should Match Reference
    [Documentation]    Checks that the PDF looks like the reference file from data/reference.
    [Arguments]    ${pdf}    ${reference_file}
    ${reference}    Reference File    ${reference_file}
    Compare Two Pdfs    ${reference}    ${pdf}

PDF Should Include Texts
    [Documentation]    Checks that all given texts are in the PDF.
    [Arguments]    ${pdf}    @{texts}
    Check Texts In Pdf    ${pdf}    @{texts}
